<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Daily Potato</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive, sans-serif;
      background: #fff8dc;
      color: #333;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .potato-img {
      width: 250px;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    form {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      background: #f9f9f9;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    input, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
    }
    button {
      background-color: #ffcc00;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover {
      background-color: #ffaa00;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Meet Your Daily Potato</h1>
  <h2>This is Gerald</h2>
  <img class="potato-img" src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/Patates.jpg" alt="Gerald the Potato">
  <p>Gerald once auditioned to be an extra in a mashed potato commercial, but he got stage fright and rolled off the set. He enjoys quiet evenings and pretending he's a turnip to confuse the others.</p>

  <h3>Apply to Adopt Gerald</h3>
  <p><strong>Warning:</strong> Gerald only responds to the funniest applications.</p>
  <form action="https://formsubmit.co/karlossfandango@gmail.com" method="POST">
    <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Gerald Adoption Application">
    <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
    <textarea name="message" rows="6" placeholder="Why are YOU the chosen one to raise Gerald? (Make it ridiculous!)" required></textarea>
    <button type="submit">Submit Your Application</button>
  </form>
</body>
</html>
